  "body": "Auction 18th November at 6 pm in rooms - Harcourts Whangaparaoa (Unless Sold Prior).\r\nProperty documents can be downloaded here: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/4YQE\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms. Three levels. Endless possibilities. Auction brings your opportunity.\r\nSome homes offer space. Others offer flexibility. And then there are homes like this, where an exceptional renovation brings both together in one impressive package.\r\nWelcome to 29A Little Barrier Avenue, Manly, where this substantial, North facing, three-level home has been beautifully transformed by Haybro Construction. Quality craftsmanship, contemporary finishes and attention to detail are evident throughout, creating a home that feels fresh, refined and ready to enjoy.\r\nA brand-new kitchen, beautifully updated bathrooms, new flooring and carpets, fresh paint and LED lighting set the scene, while generous living spaces adapt easily to changing family needs. The main living area enjoys plenty of natural light, a lovely outlook across Manly and a glimpse of the sea, with doors opening onto a new front deck perfect for relaxing and entertaining.\r\nSpread across three levels, four bedrooms and multiple living zones offer outstanding flexibility for growing families, blended households and multi-generational living. The generous upper level, with excellent storage and an elevated outlook towards Whangaparaoa Bay, offers options for a private retreat, media room or second lounge. Downstairs, a separate bedroom, living area and bathroom provide excellent independence for teenagers, extended family or guests, with provision for a future kitchenette subject to the necessary checks and approvals.\r\nOutside, enjoy new decking, a private patio, a garden shed and generous off-street parking, with room for multiple vehicles and the potential to accommodate the boat or recreational toys.\r\nThe location seals the deal, with Whangaparaoa shopping centre, the college and Penlink all within easy reach, the local primary school nearby and Manly Beach at the end of the road. It's a fantastic coastal setting that makes everyday living a pleasure.\r\nMake no mistake, this one is ready for the next owner. This is your opportunity to secure a beautifully renovated home with space to grow and flexibility for the future. The hard work has been done. Now it's your turn to make it yours.\r\nCome and explore the possibilities. You won't want to miss this one.",
